<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <ScenTitle>Dawn Strike</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; COLOR: white; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-themecolor: background1'&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: white; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-themecolor: background1'&gt;United Nations&amp;nbsp;vs. North Korea&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: white; LINE-HEIGHT: 107%; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-themecolor: background1'&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto"&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: white; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-themecolor: background1'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Date/Time:&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: white; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-themecolor: background1'&gt;&amp;nbsp;2nd July 1950/ 20:15:00 Zulu&lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Location:&lt;/B&gt; North Korea&lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Duration:&lt;/B&gt;&amp;nbsp;10 Hours&lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Playable Sides:&lt;/B&gt;&amp;nbsp;United Nations&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: "Times New Roman",serif; COLOR: white; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-themecolor: background1'&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto"&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: white; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-themecolor: background1'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Situation&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: white; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-themecolor: background1; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;The first Carrier Strike of the Korean War was conducted by the USS Valley Forge and HMS Triumph against Airfields and infrastructure in Western Korea.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: white; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-themecolor: background1; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Whilst Valley Forge had a mixture of propeller and Jet aircraft in the form of F9F Panthers, Triumphs CAG was WW2 era Seafire and Fireflies.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: white; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-themecolor: background1; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-style: italic'&gt;USS Valley Forge&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: white; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-themecolor: background1; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin'&gt; deployed to the Far East, departing the west coast on 1 May 1950. On the 25&lt;SUP&gt;th&lt;/SUP&gt; June While anchored in Hong Kong harbour Valley Forge received the news that North Korean Forces had crossed the 38th parallel into South Korea.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: white; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-themecolor: background1; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;The next day Valley Forge sailed to Subic Bay to refuel and store ship then sailed to Korea to commence Operations against North Korea.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: white; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-themecolor: background1; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin'&gt;HMS Triumph was part of the 1st Aircraft Carrier Squad&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: white; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-themecolor: background1'&gt;ron and had just left Japan en route for Hong Kong when Communist North Korean forces commenced their assault over the 38th Parallel and into South Korea on the 25th June 1950. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: white; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-themecolor: background1; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin'&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;This passage to Hong Kong should have been the first leg of HMS Triumph’s passage back home to the UK in order to retire its elderly Seafires and Fireflies, but instead the fleet joined Task Force 77 to conduct operations against North Korea&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: white; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-themecolor: background1; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: white; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-themecolor: background1; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin"&gt;Paul Bridge&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: white; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-themecolor: background1'&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: white; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-themecolor: background1"&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Author and Scenario Designer&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style='FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: white; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: "Times New Roman"; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB; mso-themecolor: background1'&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
